    "body": "I added a text wrap feature to `prettyprint` and set text width 80 as the default value.\r\nI implemented a simple approach to wrap texts at `+` or `-` only. It does not wrap text at `*` and (in)equalities.\r\nSo, the `wrap` value is not a hard constraint (i.e., some text may exceed).\r\nBut, I think it's enough comprehensive. See https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-optimization/pull/370#discussion_r873707634 for examples.",
